# An sqlplus session through dbbat against Oracle 23ai Free whose select
# list carries a genuine LONG and a genuine LONG RAW column (see
# ociLongQuery): every server payload that leads with a describe (TTC 0x10)
# or a ROW_HEADER (TTC 0x06), as the TNS Data payload with its two data-flag
# bytes first — exactly as extractTTCPayload gets it.
#
# It exists to answer one question the thin recordings could not: whether
# the indicator-and-return-code trailer a LONG column carries there is the
# thin dialect's spelling or the protocol's. See readInlineLongColumn.
#
# Regenerate with:
#   ORACLE_CAPTURE_OCI_FIXTURES=1 ORACLE_TEST_OCI_CLIENT=container \
#     go test -tags integration -run TestCapture_OCILongFetchThroughDBBat ./internal/proxy/oracle/






